@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Pre-bid on an item before an auction - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Buying items";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Pre-bid on an item before an auction";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)), url('/img/help_center/pre_bid_hero.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">
        <p><strong>Pre-bidding lets you place a bid before an auction goes live.</strong> A pre-bid acts as a maximum bid, and will automatically bid for you until your max amount has been reached.</p>
        <p>You can read more about bidding incrementally in our policies here.</p>

        <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">How pre-bidding works</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Before you pre-bid</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">How to place a pre-bid</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Pre-bid Expiration</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Frequently asked questions (FAQs)</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How pre-bidding works</h2>
        <p>When you place a pre-bid, your max bid represents the highest amount you're willing to pay for an item.</p>
        <p>If you're the highest bidder, your bid will reflect:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>The item's starting price, or...</li>
            <li>The next highest bid of other buyers.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class="article-info-box">
            You will only be charged when your bid wins. You can increase or decrease your bid amount any time before the auction starts.
        </div>

        <h2>How to place a pre-bid</h2>
        <p>To place a pre-bid before the auction starts, you can tap on the pre-bid button...</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Find the item you want to bid on.</li>
            <li>Tap on the item to see the details screen.</li>
            <li>Select the 'Pre-bid' button at the bottom of the screen.</li>
            <li>Enter your maximum bid amount.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="text-center my-4">
            <img src="~/img/help_center/pre_bid.png" alt="Buy Now, Pay Later options" class="img-fluid" style="border-radius: 12px;" />
        </div>

        <h2>Frequently asked questions (FAQs)</h2>
        <h3>Are pre-bids binding?</h3>
        <p>Yes. If you place a pre-bid, it acts as a commitment to purchase if you win the auction.</p>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>6 out of 10 found this helpful</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
